--- archive -- archive format abstractions for the handl runtime.
---
--- This is a trait-abstraction library: the Archive trait and ArchiveEntry
--- live in Rust (plugin-lib-archive) and are implemented by concrete
--- archive format crates (tar). There are no callable handl ops here;
--- the .hnl file exists to declare the library's capability surface for
--- the plugin system.
---
--- ## Capability declarations (ADR-0077 Phase 1)
--- archive.pack -- pack entries into an archive.
--- archive.unpack -- unpack an archive into entries.
cap "archive.pack"
cap "archive.unpack"
